			"text": "| #  | System                          | Suggested Architecture | Why                                                           |\n| -- | ------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1  | Small Blog                      | Monolithic             | Simple CRUD, low traffic                                      |\n| 2  | Portfolio Website               | Serverless             | Minimal backend, cost-efficient                               |\n| 3  | E-commerce MVP                  | Monolithic             | Quick to build, easy deployment                               |\n| 4  | E-commerce Large                | Microservices          | Independent scaling of Order, Payment, Inventory              |\n| 5  | Ride Sharing                    | Event-Driven           | Asynchronous workflows for ride assignment & billing          |\n| 6  | Chat App                        | Event-Driven           | Real-time messaging, decoupled services                       |\n| 7  | Image Upload Service            | Serverless             | Triggered by S3, no server management                         |\n| 8  | Payment Gateway                 | Microservices          | Independent services for payment processing & fraud detection |\n| 9  | Analytics Platform              | Event-Driven           | Streaming data processing, decoupled services                 |\n| 10 | Social Media MVP                | Monolithic             | Start small, scale later                                      |\n| 11 | Social Media Full               | Microservices          | Feed service, notification service, user service              |\n| 12 | Video Streaming                 | Microservices          | Independent services for encoding, delivery, user accounts    |\n| 13 | Server Monitoring Tool          | Serverless             | Event-based alerts, cost-efficient                            |\n| 14 | IoT Device Management           | Event-Driven           | Async device events, real-time updates                        |\n| 15 | Inventory Management Small      | Monolithic             | Easy CRUD, low concurrency                                    |\n| 16 | Inventory Management Enterprise | Microservices          | Separate stock, orders, reporting services                    |\n| 17 | Notification System             | Event-Driven           | Decoupled sending to email, SMS, push                         |\n| 18 | Logging System                  | Event-Driven           | High throughput, multiple consumers                           |\n| 19 | AI Inference API                | Serverless             | Short-lived function calls, scalable on demand                |\n| 20 | Booking System                  | Microservices          | Booking, payment, notification decoupled                      |\n| 21 | CMS Small                       | Monolithic             | Simple admin panel and content                                |\n| 22 | CMS Enterprise                  | Microservices          | Separate editor, workflow, publishing services                |\n| 23 | Email Service                   | Event-Driven           | Event-driven to handle retries & throttling                   |\n| 24 | File Processing Pipeline        | Serverless             | Process files triggered by upload events                      |\n| 25 | Online Exam Platform            | Microservices          | Exam service, result service, user service                    |\n| 26 | Food Delivery MVP               | Monolithic             | Small initial launch                                          |\n| 27 | Food Delivery Full              | Microservices          | Orders, delivery, payment, notifications separate             |\n| 28 | Weather Alert System            | Event-Driven           | Async alerts based on events                                  |\n| 29 | Analytics Dashboard             | Microservices          | Data ingestion, processing, dashboard services                |\n| 30 | Small ToDo App                  | Monolithic             | Simple CRUD                                                   |\n| 31 | Corporate ERP                   | Microservices          | Finance, HR, Inventory as separate services                   |\n| 32 | Video Transcoding               | Serverless             | Event-triggered video conversion                              |\n| 33 | Fraud Detection System          | Event-Driven           | Async event processing for transactions                       |\n| 34 | IoT Sensor Data Pipeline        | Event-Driven           | Streams of data from multiple devices                         |\n| 35 | Job Portal                      | Monolithic             | MVP launch with basic features                                |\n| 36 | Job Portal Large                | Microservices          | Search service, application service, notification service     |\n| 37 | Live Sports Score App           | Event-Driven           | Real-time updates                                             |\n| 38 | Image Thumbnail Generator       | Serverless             | Triggered by image upload events                              |\n| 39 | Payment Notification            | Event-Driven           | Async notifications to multiple channels                      |\n| 40 | Chatbot Backend                 | Serverless             | Event-driven function for each request                        |\n| 41 | Travel Booking                  | Microservices          | Flight, hotel, payment services                               |\n| 42 | Streaming Analytics             | Event-Driven           | Stream processing & alerts                                    |\n| 43 | E-learning MVP                  | Monolithic             | Start with small scale                                        |\n| 44 | E-learning Full                 | Microservices          | Courses, Users, Payments decoupled                            |\n| 45 | Coupon System                   | Event-Driven           | Async discount events                                         |\n| 46 | Image Recognition API           | Serverless             | Event-triggered model inference                               |\n| 47 | Small CRM                       | Monolithic             | Easy CRUD for small business                                  |\n| 48 | Large CRM                       | Microservices          | Leads, sales, reporting separated                             |\n| 49 | Notification Hub                | Event-Driven           | High-throughput, multiple channels                            |\n| 50 | Form Submission Handler         | Serverless             | Event-driven processing, low cost                             |\n",
